=== Etymology ===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|mánuðr|lang=non}} from {{term|máni||a moon|lang=non}}. Cognate English {{term|month}}, Old English {{term|monaþ|mōnað}}, German {{term|monat|lang=de}}, Danish {{term|maaned|lang=da}} and Swedish {{term|manad}}.

